#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Introduction and review of time-evolution {#1-introduction-and-review-of-"
"time-evolution}"
msgstr ""
"1. Pengenalan dan ulasan evolusi masa {#1-introduction-and-review-of-time-"
"evolution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This notebook follows the methods and techniques of lesson 7. Our goal is to"
" numerically solve the time-dependent Schrödinger equation. As discussed in "
"lesson 7, Trotterization consists in the successive application of a quantum"
" gate or gates, chosen to approximate the time evolution of a system for a "
"time slice. We repeat that discussion here for convenience. Feel free to "
"skip to the code cells below if you have recently reviewed lesson 7.\n"
msgstr ""
"Notebook ini mengikuti kaedah dan teknik dalam pelajaran 7. Matlamat kita "
"adalah untuk menyelesaikan persamaan Schrödinger bergantung-masa secara "
"berangka. Seperti yang dibincangkan dalam pelajaran 7, Trotterisasi terdiri "
"daripada aplikasi berturutan satu atau beberapa get kuantum yang dipilih "
"untuk menganggarkan evolusi masa sesuatu sistem bagi satu kepingan masa. "
"Kita ulangi perbincangan tersebut di sini untuk kemudahan. Boleh terus ke "
"sel kod di bawah jika Anda baru sahaja menyemak pelajaran 7.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Following from the Schrödinger equation, the time evolution of a system "
"initially in the state $\\vert\\psi(0)\\rangle$ takes the form:\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikutan daripada persamaan Schrödinger, evolusi masa bagi sistem yang "
"bermula dalam keadaan $\\vert\\psi(0)\\rangle$ berbentuk:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi(t) \\rangle = e^{-i H t} \\vert \\psi(0) \\rangle \\text{,}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi(t) \\rangle = e^{-i H t} \\vert \\psi(0) \\rangle \\text{,}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $H$ is the time-independent Hamiltonian governing the system. We "
"consider a Hamiltonian that can be written as a weighted sum of Pauli terms "
"$H=\\sum_j a_j P_j$, with $P_j$ representing a tensor product of Pauli terms"
" acting on $n$ qubits. In particular, these Pauli terms might commute with "
"one another, or they might not. Given a state at time $t=0$, how do we "
"obtain the system's state at a later time $|\\psi(t)\\rangle$ using a "
"quantum computer? The exponential of an operator can be most easily "
"understood through its Taylor series:\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $H$ ialah Hamiltonian tidak bergantung-masa yang mengawal sistem "
"tersebut. Kita pertimbangkan Hamiltonian yang boleh ditulis sebagai jumlah "
"berwajaran bagi sebutan Pauli $H=\\sum_j a_j P_j$, dengan $P_j$ mewakili "
"hasil darab tensor sebutan Pauli yang bertindak ke atas $n$ qubit. Secara "
"khususnya, sebutan-sebutan Pauli ini mungkin bertukar-ganti antara satu sama"
" lain, atau mungkin tidak. Diberi satu keadaan pada masa $t=0$, bagaimana "
"kita memperoleh keadaan sistem pada masa kemudian $|\\psi(t)\\rangle$ "
"menggunakan komputer kuantum? Eksponen suatu pengoperasi paling mudah "
"difahami melalui siri Taylornya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i H t} = 1-iHt-\\frac{1}{2}H^2t^2+...\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i H t} = 1-iHt-\\frac{1}{2}H^2t^2+...\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some very basic exponentials, like $e^{iZ}$ can be implemented easily on "
"quantum computers using a compact set of quantum gates. Most Hamiltonians of"
" interest will not have just a single term, but will instead have many "
"terms. Note what happens if $H = H_1+H_2$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa eksponen yang sangat asas, seperti $e^{iZ}$, boleh dilaksanakan "
"dengan mudah pada komputer kuantum menggunakan set get kuantum yang padat. "
"Kebanyakan Hamiltonian yang menarik tidak akan mempunyai hanya satu sebutan,"
" sebaliknya akan mempunyai banyak sebutan. Perhatikan apa yang berlaku jika "
"$H = H_1+H_2$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i H t} = 1-i(H_1+H_2)t-\\frac{1}{2}(H_1+H_2)^2t^2+...\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i H t} = 1-i(H_1+H_2)t-\\frac{1}{2}(H_1+H_2)^2t^2+...\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When $H_1$ and $H_2$ commute, we have the familiar case (which is also true "
"for numbers, and variables $a$ and $b$ below):\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila $H_1$ dan $H_2$ bertukar-ganti, kita mendapat kes biasa (yang juga "
"berlaku untuk nombor, dan pembolehubah $a$ dan $b$ di bawah):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i (a+b) t} = e^{-i a t}e^{-i b t}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i (a+b) t} = e^{-i a t}e^{-i b t}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"But when operators do not commute, terms cannot be rearranged in the Taylor "
"series to simplify in this way. Thus, expressing complicated Hamiltonians in"
" quantum gates is a challenge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tetapi apabila pengoperasi tidak bertukar-ganti, sebutan-sebutan tidak boleh"
" disusun semula dalam siri Taylor untuk dipermudahkan dengan cara ini. Oleh "
"itu, mengungkapkan Hamiltonian yang rumit dalam get kuantum adalah satu "
"cabaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One solution is to consider very small time $t$, such that the first-order "
"term in the Taylor expansion dominates. Under that assumption:\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu penyelesaian adalah dengan mempertimbangkan masa $t$ yang sangat kecil,"
" supaya sebutan tertib pertama dalam pengembangan Taylor mendominasi. Dengan"
" andaian tersebut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i (H_1+H_2) t} \\approx 1-i(H_1+H_2)t \\approx (1-i H_1 t)(1-i H_2 t) \\approx e^{-i H_1 t}e^{-i H_2 t}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{-i (H_1+H_2) t} \\approx 1-i(H_1+H_2)t \\approx (1-i H_1 t)(1-i H_2 t) \\approx e^{-i H_1 t}e^{-i H_2 t}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Of course, we might need to evolve our state for a longer time. That is "
"accomplished by using many such small steps in time. This process is called "
"Trotterization:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sudah tentu, kita mungkin perlu mengevolusi keadaan kita untuk tempoh masa "
"yang lebih lama. Ini dicapai dengan menggunakan banyak langkah kecil "
"sedemikian dalam masa. Proses ini dipanggil Trotterisasi:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi(t) \\rangle \\approx \\left(\\prod_j e^{-i a_j P_j t/r} \\right)^r \\vert\\psi(0) \\rangle \\text{,}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi(t) \\rangle \\approx \\left(\\prod_j e^{-i a_j P_j t/r} \\right)^r \\vert\\psi(0) \\rangle \\text{,}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here $t/r$ is the time slice (evolution step) that we are choosing. As a "
"result, a gate to be applied $r$ times is created. A smaller timestep leads "
"to a more accurate approximation. However, this also leads to deeper "
"circuits which, in practice, leads to more error accumulation (a non-"
"negligible concern on near-term quantum devices).\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini $t/r$ ialah kepingan masa (langkah evolusi) yang kita pilih. "
"Hasilnya, satu get akan diaplikasikan sebanyak $r$ kali. Langkah masa yang "
"lebih kecil menghasilkan penghampiran yang lebih tepat. Walau bagaimanapun, "
"ini juga menghasilkan litar yang lebih dalam yang, secara praktikal, membawa"
" kepada lebih banyak pengumpulan ralat (kebimbangan yang tidak boleh "
"diabaikan pada peranti kuantum jangka hampir).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Today, we will study the time evolution of the [Ising "
"model](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ising_model) on linear lattices of "
"$N=2$ and $N=6$ sites. These lattices consist of an array of spins "
"$\\sigma_i$ that interact only with their nearest neighbors. These spins can"
" have two orientations: $\\uparrow$ and $\\downarrow$, which correspond to a"
" magnetization of $+1$ and $-1$ respectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hari ini, kita akan mengkaji evolusi masa bagi [model "
"Ising](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ising_model) pada kekisi linear dengan "
"$N=2$ dan $N=6$ tapak. Kekisi-kekisi ini terdiri daripada susunan spin "
"$\\sigma_i$ yang hanya berinteraksi dengan jiran terdekat mereka. Spin-spin "
"ini boleh mempunyai dua orientasi: $\\uparrow$ dan $\\downarrow$, yang "
"masing-masing sepadan dengan kemagnetan $+1$ dan $-1$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H = - J \\sum_{i=0}^{N-2} Z_i Z_{i+1} - h \\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} X_i  \\text{,}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H = - J \\sum_{i=0}^{N-2} Z_i Z_{i+1} - h \\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} X_i  \\text{,}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $J$ describes the interaction energy, and $h$ the magnitude of an "
"external field (in the x-direction above, but we will modify this). Let us "
"write this expression using Pauli matrices, and considering that the "
"external field has an angle $\\alpha$ with respect to the transversal "
"direction,\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $J$ menerangkan tenaga interaksi, dan $h$ magnitud medan luaran "
"(dalam arah-x di atas, tetapi kita akan mengubah ini). Mari kita tulis "
"ungkapan ini menggunakan matriks Pauli, dan mempertimbangkan bahawa medan "
"luaran membuat sudut $\\alpha$ terhadap arah melintang,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H = -J \\sum_{i=0}^{N-2} Z_i Z_{i+1} -h \\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} (\\sin\\alpha Z_i + \\cos\\alpha X_i) \\text{.}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H = -J \\sum_{i=0}^{N-2} Z_i Z_{i+1} -h \\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} (\\sin\\alpha Z_i + \\cos\\alpha X_i) \\text{.}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This Hamiltonian is useful in that it allows us to easily study the effects "
"of an external field. In the computational basis, the system will be encoded"
" as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Hamiltonian ini berguna kerana ia membolehkan kita mengkaji dengan mudah "
"kesan medan luaran. Dalam asas pengiraan, sistem akan dikodkan seperti "
"berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Quantum state            | Spin representation                        |\n"
"|:------------------------:|:------------------------------------------:|\n"
"| $\\lvert 0 0 0 0 \\rangle$ | $\\uparrow\\uparrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$         |\n"
"| $\\lvert 1 0 0 0 \\rangle$ | $\\downarrow\\uparrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$       |\n"
"| $\\ldots$                 | $\\ldots$                                   |\n"
"| $\\lvert 1 1 1 1 \\rangle$ | $\\downarrow\\downarrow\\downarrow\\downarrow$ |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Keadaan kuantum            | Perwakilan spin                        |\n"
"|:------------------------:|:------------------------------------------:|\n"
"| $\\lvert 0 0 0 0 \\rangle$ | $\\uparrow\\uparrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$         |\n"
"| $\\lvert 1 0 0 0 \\rangle$ | $\\downarrow\\uparrow\\uparrow\\uparrow$       |\n"
"| $\\ldots$                 | $\\ldots$                                   |\n"
"| $\\lvert 1 1 1 1 \\rangle$ | $\\downarrow\\downarrow\\downarrow\\downarrow$ |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will start investigating the time evolution of such a quantum system. "
"More specifically, we will visualize the time-evolution of certain "
"properties of the system like magnetization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan mula menyiasat evolusi masa sistem kuantum sedemikian. Lebih "
"khusus lagi, kita akan memvisualisasikan evolusi masa bagi sifat-sifat "
"tertentu sistem seperti kemagnetan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Defining the transverse-field Ising Hamiltonian {#2-defining-the-"
"transverse-field-ising-hamiltonian}"
msgstr ""
"2. Mentakrifkan Hamiltonian Ising medan melintang {#2-defining-the-"
"transverse-field-ising-hamiltonian}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We here consider the 1-D transverse-field Ising model.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita mempertimbangkan model Ising medan melintang 1-D.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we will create a function that takes in the system parameters $N$, "
"$J$, and $h$, and returns our Hamiltonian as a `SparsePauliOp`. A "
"[SparsePauliOp](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp)"
" is a sparse representation of an operator in terms of weighted "
"[Pauli](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Pauli) "
"terms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita akan membuat fungsi yang menerima parameter sistem $N$, $J$, "
"dan $h$, dan mengembalikan Hamiltonian kita sebagai `SparsePauliOp`. "
"[SparsePauliOp](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp)"
" adalah perwakilan jarang bagi suatu pengoperasi dalam sebutan-sebutan "
"[Pauli](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Pauli) "
"berwajaran.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2.1 Activity 1 {#21-activity-1}"
msgstr "2.1 Aktiviti 1 {#21-activity-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Construct a function to build a transverse-field Ising Hamiltonian (see the "
"equation above) with arguments of \"the number of qubits\", \"J parameter\","
" and \"h parameter\". Try this on your own using previous examples. Scroll "
"down for the solution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bina satu fungsi untuk membina Hamiltonian Ising medan melintang (lihat "
"persamaan di atas) dengan argumen \"bilangan qubit\", \"parameter J\", dan "
"\"parameter h\". Cuba sendiri menggunakan contoh-contoh sebelumnya. Tatal ke"
" bawah untuk penyelesaian.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "__Solution:__\n"
msgstr "__Penyelesaian:__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will start investigating the time evolution of a quantum system, while keeping track of magnetization.\n"
"We here compare the results of the Statevector and Matrix Product State simulators.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan mula menyiasat evolusi masa sistem kuantum, sambil memantau kemagnetan.\n"
"Di sini kita membandingkan hasil daripada simulator Statevector dan Matrix Product State.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Define the Hamiltonian {#define-the-hamiltonian}"
msgstr "Takrifkan Hamiltonian {#define-the-hamiltonian}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The system that we now consider has a size of $N=20$.\n"
msgstr "Sistem yang kita pertimbangkan sekarang mempunyai saiz $N=20$.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the parameters of the time-evolution simulation {#set-the-parameters-of-"
"the-time-evolution-simulation}"
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan parameter simulasi evolusi masa {#set-the-parameters-of-the-time-"
"evolution-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here we will consider the Lie–Trotter (first order).\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita akan mempertimbangkan Lie–Trotter (tertib pertama).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prepare the quantum circuit (Initial state) {#prepare-the-quantum-circuit-"
"initial-state}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan litar kuantum (Keadaan awal) {#prepare-the-quantum-circuit-initial-"
"state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an initial state. We will start from the ground state, which is a "
"ferromagnetic state (all up or all down). Here, we use an example of all ups"
" (which is all '0').\n"
msgstr ""
"Buat keadaan awal. Kita akan bermula dari keadaan asas, iaitu keadaan "
"feromagnetik (semua atas atau semua bawah). Di sini, kita menggunakan contoh"
" semua atas (iaitu semua '0').\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/f3f6c2f1-63b7-4bb8-83d3-af579900ea6f-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/f3f6c2f1-63b7-4bb8-83d3-af579900ea6f-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prepare the quantum circuit 2 (Single circuit for time evolution) {#prepare-"
"the-quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-evolution}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan litar kuantum 2 (litar tunggal untuk evolusi masa) {#prepare-the-"
"quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-evolution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We here construct a circuit for a single time step using Lie–Trotter.\n"
"The Lie product formula (first order) is implemented in the [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) class. A first-order formula consists of the approximation stated in the introduction, where the matrix exponential of a sum is approximated by a product of matrix exponentials:\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kita membina litar untuk satu langkah masa menggunakan Lie–Trotter.\n"
"Formula hasil darab Lie (tertib pertama) dilaksanakan dalam kelas [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter). Formula tertib pertama terdiri daripada penghampiran yang dinyatakan dalam pengenalan, di mana eksponen matriks bagi suatu hasil tambah dianggarkan dengan hasil darab eksponen matriks:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"
"Let us count the operations for this circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"
"Mari kita kira operasi untuk litar ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-outputs/dbc253b8-17a1-4cb7-aede-"
"bddfa59fab8a-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-outputs/dbc253b8-17a1-4cb7-aede-"
"bddfa59fab8a-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set the operators to be measured {#set-the-operators-to-be-measured}"
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan pengoperasi yang akan diukur {#set-the-operators-to-be-measured}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Let us define a *magnetization operator* $\\sum_i Z_i  / N$.\n"
msgstr "Mari kita takrifkan *pengoperasi kemagnetan* $\\sum_i Z_i  / N$.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Perform time-evolution simulation {#perform-time-evolution-simulation}"
msgstr "Jalankan simulasi evolusi masa {#perform-time-evolution-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will monitor the magnetization (expectation value of the magnetization "
"operator). We will use Statevector and MPS simulators and compare the "
"results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan memantau kemagnetan (nilai jangkaan pengoperasi kemagnetan). Kita "
"akan menggunakan simulator Statevector dan MPS serta membandingkan "
"keputusan.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Plot the time evolution of the observables {#plot-the-time-evolution-of-the-"
"observables}"
msgstr ""
"Plot evolusi masa bagi nilai boleh cerap {#plot-the-time-evolution-of-the-"
"observables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We plot the expectation values we measured against time. Confirm that the "
"results from statevector and matrix product space simulators agree.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita plot nilai jangkaan yang kita ukur berbanding masa. Pastikan bahawa "
"keputusan daripada simulator statevector dan matrix product space "
"bersetuju.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/7583b935-afce-40c8-807d-6d61d43af13c-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/7583b935-afce-40c8-807d-6d61d43af13c-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will start investigating the time evolution of a quantum system, while keeping track of properties.\n"
"We here compare the results of the Matrix Product State simulator and the actual quantum device.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan mula menyiasat evolusi masa sistem kuantum, sambil memantau sifat-sifat sistem.\n"
"Di sini kita membandingkan keputusan daripada simulator Matrix Product State dengan peranti kuantum sebenar.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2.2 Activity 2 {#22-activity-2}"
msgstr "2.2 Aktiviti 2 {#22-activity-2}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Define the Hamiltonian {#define-the-hamiltonian-1}"
msgstr "Takrifkan Hamiltonian {#define-the-hamiltonian-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The system that we now consider has a size of $N=70$. Note that the other "
"conditions are the same from the 20-qubit problem. Try this on your own; "
"scroll down for the solution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sistem yang kita pertimbangkan sekarang mempunyai saiz $N=70$. Perhatikan "
"bahawa syarat-syarat lain adalah sama dengan masalah 20-qubit. Cuba sendiri;"
" tatal ke bawah untuk penyelesaian.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2.3 Activity 3 {#23-activity-3}"
msgstr "2.3 Aktiviti 3 {#23-activity-3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an initial state. We will start from the ground state, which is a "
"ferromagnetic state (all up or all down). Here, we use an example of all ups"
" (which is all '0'). Try this on your own; scroll down for the solution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buat keadaan awal. Kita akan bermula dari keadaan asas, iaitu keadaan "
"feromagnetik (semua atas atau semua bawah). Di sini, kita menggunakan contoh"
" semua atas (iaitu semua '0'). Cuba sendiri; tatal ke bawah untuk "
"penyelesaian.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/edacae4b-ab0e-4f1b-8c3d-001ade87e64e-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/edacae4b-ab0e-4f1b-8c3d-001ade87e64e-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2.4 Activity 4 {#24-activity-4}"
msgstr "2.4 Aktiviti 4 {#24-activity-4}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prepare the quantum circuit 2 (Single circuit for time evolution) for the "
"70-qubit problem {#prepare-the-quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-"
"evolution-for-the-70-qubit-problem}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan litar kuantum 2 (litar tunggal untuk evolusi masa) bagi masalah "
"70-qubit {#prepare-the-quantum-circuit-2-single-circuit-for-time-evolution-"
"for-the-70-qubit-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We here construct a circuit for a single time step using Lie–Trotter.\n"
"Exactly as in the 20-qubit case, the Lie product formula (first order) is implemented in the [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) class. Again, the first-order formula consists of the approximation stated above:\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kita membina litar untuk satu langkah masa menggunakan Lie–Trotter.\n"
"Sama seperti dalam kes 20-qubit, formula hasil darab Lie (tertib pertama) dilaksanakan dalam kelas [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter). Sekali lagi, formula tertib pertama terdiri daripada penghampiran yang dinyatakan di atas:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Try this yourself, building from the example of the 20-qubit case. As "
"before, count the operations for this circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cuba sendiri, bina daripada contoh kes 20-qubit. Seperti sebelumnya, kira "
"operasi untuk litar ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/4f3385fc-d214-4405-8e37-eefe45cee98c-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/4f3385fc-d214-4405-8e37-eefe45cee98c-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2.5 Activity 5 {#25-activity-5}"
msgstr "2.5 Aktiviti 5 {#25-activity-5}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set the operators to be measured {#set-the-operators-to-be-measured-1}"
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan pengoperasi yang akan diukur {#set-the-operators-to-be-measured-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We define a *magnetization operator* exactly analogous to the one from the "
"20-qubit case: $\\sum_i Z_i  / N$. Try this yourself by modifying the "
"20-qubit solution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita takrifkan *pengoperasi kemagnetan* yang serupa dengan kes 20-qubit: "
"$\\sum_i Z_i  / N$. Cuba sendiri dengan mengubah suai penyelesaian "
"20-qubit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2.6 Activity 6 {#26-activity-6}"
msgstr "2.6 Aktiviti 6 {#26-activity-6}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Perform time-evolution simulation {#perform-time-evolution-simulation-1}"
msgstr "Jalankan simulasi evolusi masa {#perform-time-evolution-simulation-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will monitor the magnetization (expectation value of the magnetization "
"operator). We will use the MPS simulator to get the reference value to "
"compare the results computed from the hardware. You have used the MPS "
"simulator before in this tutorial. Modify that example where necessary to "
"fit this new calculation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan memantau kemagnetan (nilai jangkaan pengoperasi kemagnetan). Kita "
"akan menggunakan simulator MPS untuk mendapatkan nilai rujukan bagi "
"membandingkan keputusan yang dikira dari perkakasan. Anda telah menggunakan "
"simulator MPS sebelum ini dalam tutorial ini. Ubah suai contoh tersebut "
"mengikut keperluan pengiraan baru ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As in all previous lessons, we will implement the Qiskit patterns framework."
" The lesson up to this point has been focused on creating the correct "
"quantum circuits to describe our problem. This is effectively Step 1.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti dalam semua pelajaran sebelumnya, kita akan melaksanakan rangka "
"kerja corak Qiskit. Pelajaran sehingga titik ini telah difokuskan kepada "
"membina litar kuantum yang betul untuk menerangkan masalah kita. Ini secara "
"efektifnya adalah Langkah 1.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize for target hardware {#step-2-optimize-for-target-hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Optimumkan untuk perkakasan sasaran {#step-2-optimize-for-target-"
"hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We start by defining the target backend.\n"
msgstr "Kita mulakan dengan menakrifkan backend sasaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We transpile the circuits and gather them in a list. This might take a few "
"minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita transpilkan litar dan kumpulkan dalam satu senarai. Ini mungkin "
"mengambil beberapa minit.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute on target hardware {#step-3-execute-on-target-hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 3: Laksanakan pada perkakasan sasaran {#step-3-execute-on-target-"
"hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will define the Runtime Estimator and construct the list of PUBs. We must"
" also apply the layout to the operators to be measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menakrifkan Runtime Estimator dan membina senarai PUB. Kita juga "
"perlu mengaplikasikan tataletak kepada pengoperasi yang akan diukur.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We are now ready to run the job.\n"
msgstr "Kita kini bersedia untuk menjalankan kerja.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process results {#step-4-post-process-results}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Proses pasca keputusan {#step-4-post-process-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We will first get the results.\n"
msgstr "Kita akan mendapatkan keputusan terlebih dahulu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Now we must extract the expectation values from these results.\n"
msgstr "Kini kita perlu mengekstrak nilai jangkaan daripada keputusan ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will use this for comparison below. First, let us see if we can optimize "
"our circuits even further.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menggunakan ini untuk perbandingan di bawah. Pertama, mari kita "
"lihat sama ada kita boleh mengoptimumkan litar kita dengan lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Solution using a real quantum computer II {#3-solution-using-a-real-"
"quantum-computer-ii}"
msgstr ""
"3. Penyelesaian menggunakan komputer kuantum sebenar II {#3-solution-using-"
"a-real-quantum-computer-ii}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us return to Qiskit patterns step 1, and see if we can reduce the depth "
"of our circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari kita kembali ke langkah 1 pola Qiskit, dan lihat sama ada kita boleh "
"mengurangkan kedalaman litar kita.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3.1 Step 1. Map the problem to quantum circuits and operators "
"{#31-step-1-map-the-problem-to-quantum-circuits-and-operators}"
msgstr ""
"3.1 Langkah 1. Petakan masalah kepada litar dan operator kuantum "
"{#31-step-1-map-the-problem-to-quantum-circuits-and-operators}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Activity 7 {#activity-7}"
msgstr "Aktiviti 7 {#activity-7}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Construct a time-evolution circuit. Use your knowledge from previous lessons"
" to try to reduce the depth of the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bina litar evolusi masa. Gunakan pengetahuan anda dari pelajaran sebelumnya "
"untuk cuba mengurangkan kedalaman litar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/769902d2-acce-4252-8c44-cba3cc0f9be5-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/769902d2-acce-4252-8c44-cba3cc0f9be5-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This was very successful. We can now proceed with the remaining Qiskit "
"patterns steps.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini sangat berjaya. Kita kini boleh meneruskan dengan langkah-langkah pola "
"Qiskit yang selebihnya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3.2 Step 2. Optimize for target hardware {#32-step-2-optimize-for-target-"
"hardware}"
msgstr ""
"3.2 Langkah 2. Optimumkan untuk perkakasan sasaran {#32-step-2-optimize-for-"
"target-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Transpile the circuits and gather them in a list. Once again, this might "
"take a few minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Transpile litar-litar dan kumpulkan dalam senarai. Sekali lagi, ini mungkin "
"mengambil masa beberapa minit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Define the Runtime Estimator and construct the list of PUBs.\n"
msgstr "Takrifkan Runtime Estimator dan bina senarai PUB.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3.3 Step 3. Execute on target hardware {#33-step-3-execute-on-target-"
"hardware}"
msgstr ""
"3.3 Langkah 3. Jalankan pada perkakasan sasaran {#33-step-3-execute-on-"
"target-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the job.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Get the results.\n"
msgstr "Dapatkan keputusan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.4 Step 4. Post-processing {#34-step-4-post-processing}"
msgstr "3.4 Langkah 4. Pemprosesan selepas {#34-step-4-post-processing}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Extract the expectation values from the results.\n"
msgstr "Ekstrak nilai jangkaan dari keputusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transform the list into numpy arrays for plotting.\n"
msgstr "Tukar senarai kepada tatasusunan numpy untuk diplot.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let us plot the results and compare the hardware (default and shallow "
"circuit) results with the MPS simulator. How does the error in the real "
"hardware influence the results?\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang mari kita plot keputusan dan bandingkan hasil perkakasan (litar "
"lalai dan litar cetek) dengan simulator MPS. Bagaimana ralat dalam "
"perkakasan sebenar mempengaruhi keputusan?\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/83c809cb-299c-4071-a662-d10ba7e24996-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-"
"outputs/83c809cb-299c-4071-a662-d10ba7e24996-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You have moved one step further in your utility-scale "
"quantum journey. There is only one lesson left!\n"
msgstr ""
"Tahniah! Anda telah melangkah lebih jauh dalam perjalanan kuantum berskala "
"utiliti Anda. Hanya tinggal satu pelajaran lagi!\n"
